  lore: {
    about: "This enemy has a higher RES to Spectro DMG . When hit by an Echo Skill, Sigillum gains 1 stack of Off Course, up to 5 stacks. Echoes with the same name can only trigger this effect once. Each stack of Off Course makes it take 10% more total DMG. At 5 stacks, Sigillum takes an additional 30% total DMG. Rage and tears. Suffering and joy. Sorrow and pain. All are condensed, along with her sigh, into a single golden frequency. It gazes at the sky, lost in memories worn thin by the ages. The lost voyager is still searching for the way home.",
    undiscovered: "A wordless black mech, lost and longing to return home.",
  },
